1. **Comprehensive problem sourcing from premier competitions**: AetherCode is the first benchmark to systematically collect problems from top-tier OI and ICPC competitions worldwide, which genuinely raises the difficulty ceiling beyond existing benchmarks that draw from LeetCode/CodeForces. This addresses a real gap in the evaluation landscape.

