1. **Run and report all three baselines on both datasets.** This is the single most important missing piece—without it, the paper has no empirical argument for superiority.

2. **Report Hallucination Rate and AST Fidelity numbers for all methods.** These are your own proposed metrics; omitting their results undermines credibility.

3. **Evaluate on a real bug-fixing or refactoring benchmark** (e.g., SWE-bench) where tasks require genuine code understanding, not just annotation insertion.

