2. From ContextGNN (nzOD1we8Z4.md): Novelty concerns, lack of time complexity analysis, limited dataset diversity, lack of code availability.
3. From Dual-Encoders for XMC (dNe1T0Ahby.md): Presentation issues, novelty concerns.
4. From Relevance-Based Embeddings (mssRRt6OPE.md and aDG34Bhbs1.md): Scalability concerns (small datasets), lack of timing information, weak baselines.
5. From ConvFormer (Gny0PVtKz2.md): Data leakage concerns in evaluation, baseline fairness concerns.
6. From Embedding Collapse (0IaTFNJner.md): Marginal performance improvements.
