4. **Validate the modular factorization assumption on real data.** The theory hinges on Eq. 2 (approximate conditional factorization), but the real experiment uses an ensemble of MLPs with no modular architecture. There is no test of whether the learned representation is modular, whether modules can be meaningfully recombined, or whether the factorization assumption holds at all.

