1. **Report computational cost.** The framework requires multiple LLM calls per sample per rule per iteration. Without cost or latency analysis, practical viability is unclear—this could be prohibitively expensive at scale.
2. **Statistical significance tests.** Results across datasets are close (e.g., 82.3 vs. 80.5 on Dreaddit). Report whether differences are statistically significant given the small test sets (n=300).
