2. **Finite-sample CI test reliability**: The algorithm assumes oracle CI tests for theoretical results but uses finite-sample tests in practice. Analyze how error propagation in CI tests (especially across multiple intervention conditions) affects F-PAG recovery; constraint-based methods are known to be brittle here.

