1. **Novel and systematic probing methodology**: The deletion-based framework for intercepting and manipulating CoT mid-generation is a creative evaluation paradigm that goes beyond standard accuracy metrics. The three deletion strategies (from-the-end, random, physics-aware) provide complementary perspectives on how models depend on different parts of their reasoning traces.

