Based on my thorough analysis of related human reviews from text-to-SQL benchmarks, interactive/agent benchmarks, and multi-turn evaluation frameworks, here are the strengths and weaknesses for BIRD-INTERACT:

**Similar paper paths and score ranges:**
- Spider 2.0 (text-to-SQL benchmark): scores 8,8,8,8
- τ-bench (tool-agent-user interaction): scores 8,6,6,6
- MINT (multi-turn interaction with tools/feedback): scores 5,8,8,6
