2. **Analyze how the size of Pos grows over time and its impact on policy quality.** Under prolonged non-observation, Pos can grow to cover most of the graph, making the belief-averaged policy increasingly uninformative. The paper does not analyze this failure mode or the expected game lengths before re-observation.

