3. **Strong quantitative results**: WithAnyone achieves the highest Sim(GT) on MultiID-Bench's single-person subset while maintaining a low Copy-Paste score, effectively breaking the observed trade-off curve (Fig. 5). This is a notable improvement over prior work.

